# macOS
.DS_Store

# Records of finished playthroughs live on the `playthroughs` branch, never on
# main. They are ~25MB of the highest-grade spoilers in the project -- raw
# transcripts, novelisations with every ending, and four campaigns' end states
# -- and they used to ship to players inside the plugin, held back by nothing
# but a "do not read" list in skills/purewater/SKILL.md.
#
# Ignoring them here stops an `export-campaign` or a stray `cp` putting them
# back into a release. To work with them: git checkout playthroughs
session-logs/
novels/
archive/
